//! task: fix
//! ask: Declare a wire struct with a 4-bit field followed by a byte.
//! expect: EXS-E0322
//! refs: §5.2
//! explain: Declared widths in a `@transitus` type must sum to a whole number of bytes. A lone `u4` leaves half a byte unwritten, which is implicit padding and so `EXS-E0322`. Pair it with another nibble, or name the unused bits explicitly. Sub-byte fields pack MSB-first.

@transitus
publica structura Capitulum {
    a: u4
    b: u8
}
//@ fixed
@transitus
publica structura Capitulum {
    a: u4
    reserva: u4
    b: u8
}
